<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-21T22:33:28.008Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 22:33:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican authorities have recently arrested five suspects linked to the Vizsla silver mining murders, including a man known as El Talibán, and a federal grand jury has added another Amarillo man to a Sinaloa Cartel weapons conspiracy. A woman with cartel ties who was wanted for her daughter’s 1997 murder was detained in Mexico after a decade on the run. The United States has restricted airspace and drone flights near the Mexican border to counter cartel drone traffic. Ukrainian-origin fiber-optic drones are being investigated for cartel use. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPQ2J4RHIwY0c5ZmwzaGg4VmNYbG5kYWNwckU4d3dYSWxyUUVKMDk0U01jcm5fSllLMk91NEFDcDhraTlTS2Foa0dfbkZUQ0Jpa3NHZEp3NkpORkk4bHdzWTJPWlEtTHF5YlQ3SkpwZWYtbm4zb2U2dHBOT3c0ZWs3dEtEY0dvSmxMNGlvYlVDX254N1IyQTNhN2xLWTFncnozWTVsSEJ3dm5JOXhlWjFkMGl2WmpqMmRyRldqNg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxQTWtSVDNRakoyTDJQSEpsc2I2TTh1QzQ0X3QxbXRZM2plOTRJRDA0UVJiZ3hoSFhDZVVpQWJmSUEyRWZ0UndnZklrS25ZakotOU0tMGpDQWxxQlRQcEJSbmo3cFA1Y0NPUExUM3JwT0s4S05hM195RVZkLU5VaTZWeGZlRjdZNGZjNGFES3l1V0VDLVg2NlJIUDZTUjVoUkZOQzdWeWs4a0pMUVNtZWl6WDVpQmZraWxqYVNpbWVhc3R4MmkxdXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsNation&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPZXFaVlB6REZKdUlobzREdzNUSkRuZDR1ZU8wbXA1Sjk2NFJnNzRQc0JUSEY4SVl6R1lEdXkteHJJb0pXOXlyN2JadEFDVlFTU2M4S2pTdVc4RERnT18wOUctcWZVQ0Z5bDBsdmhNTF9aVmZ5aUxtUnlPTGQ2WXRfOEtpbzE3OHdLR3BUQXlDakczUU5PY2xWbmNfcDg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Us Weekly&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxPRkNhXzJPX2cwN0FwRjM2aFhRZkVqVGlJcWhUQzRaTEJBNHY1UjRpVUtpaEhibkp4SGZzc05FVGxrUW8w